  "title": "Mobius: Fine Tuning Large-scale Models on Commodity GPU Servers",
  "abstract": "Fine-tuning on cheap commodity GPU servers makes large-scale deep learning models benefit more people. However, the low inter-GPU communication bandwidth and pressing communication contention on the commodity GPU server obstruct training efficiency.",
